 poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/5f3815e5ecfd76ba030ad05add183ce0.poster.avif?t=1749208480\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/5f3815e5ecfd76ba030ad05add183ce0.webm?t=1749208480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/5f3815e5ecfd76ba030ad05add183ce0.mp4?t=1749208480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >| A JOURNEY LIKE NO OTHER |</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting to the town is just the start. What happens next is a mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/500a2ac6fe34972b4714eb33376ed0b1.poster.avif?t=1749208480\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/500a2ac6fe34972b4714eb33376ed0b1.webm?t=1749208480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3137450/extras/500a2ac6fe34972b4714eb33376ed0b1.mp4?t=1749208480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project wouldn't be possible without DaveFace's Psx Shader and Horror Engine plug-in for Unreal Engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOCIAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For development updates, you can follow along on YouTube, Twitter &amp; TikTok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All music is created by Leiwaan,  Delancey Throne &amp; Thomas Hansen.</p>",
